> Measure the implementation that actually runs

This version builds explicit vectors of member occurrences and stable-sorts each merged list. It is not an optimized linear merge implementation of package-merge. Its selected work includes O(NL log N) sorting plus the actual membership copying cost; member-list storage can dominate. The native counter counts every membership written into working singleton, package and list buffers. Sorting moves coin objects rather than claiming every such move as a copied membership; trace-copy storage is counted separately.

For a power-of-two number N=2^b of equal weights and cap b, the only complete feasible lengths are all b, so weighted cost is Nb. The following measured lists/packages/copies are actual native work on that controlled family, not CPU timings or an asserted asymptotic fit.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/package_merge_work.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  std::vector<double> x, copies;
  std::print(
      "| equal-weight symbols | cap | actual packages | actual levels | actual member copies | "
      "actual selected membership visits | exact weighted cost |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | "
      "---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
  for (int bits = 2; bits <= 7; ++bits) {
    std::size_t n = std::size_t(1) << bits;
    auto        r = dm::algorithms::package_merge_run(std::vector<std::uint64_t>(n, 1), bits);
    x.push_back(n);
    copies.push_back(r.work.member_copies);
    std::print(
        "| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n",
        n,
        bits,
        r.work.packages,
        r.work.levels,
        r.work.member_copies,
        r.work.selected_member_visits,
        dm::algorithms::package_merge_cost_decimal(r.weighted_cost));
  }
  auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  p.lines(x, copies, "working member copies", dm::graphics::RGBA{37, 99, 235, 255})
      .points(x, copies, dm::graphics::RGBA{37, 99, 235, 255}, 3.);
  p.title("Explicit package lists: actual member-copy work")
      .x_label("equal-weight symbol count")
      .y_label("actual membership elements copied")
      .save_svg("build/package_merge_work.svg");
}
```
